ll,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5361881815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117127#issuecomment-5361881815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117127","id":5361881815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP5fS1w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T21:25:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T21:25:36Z","body":"Are you able to provide clear reproduction steps or an MRP? There's not much we can do otherwise","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5361881815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5370445295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117127#issuecomment-5370445295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117127","id":5370445295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQBp97w","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T13:34:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T13:34:11Z","body":"Here's an updated MRP that reproduces the issue on my side. \n[117127-tile-set-editor-lag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31307296/117127-tile-set-editor-lag.zip)\n\nWhat I did is to add another very huge atlas source, so that the problem becomes obvious on more powerful machines.\nSteps:\n1. Open the project.\n2. Start editing \"world.tscn\".\n3. Select the TileMapLayer node, \"World/Grass\", to edit its TileSet.\n4. Open the TileSet editor bottom panel.\n5. Select the atlas source named \"colored-transparent_packed.png\", the new one I added.\n6. Click the \"Paint\" button to switch to paint mode.\n7. Select \"Terrain\" out of the \"Paint Properties\" dropdown.\n8. Select \"Terrain 0\" out of the \"Terrain Set\" dropdown.\n9. **DONE.** Right now if you hover your cursor over the image and move around, or hold MMB and drag around, it should be really laggy: the tile highlight won't update quickly enough, or the position of the image.\n10. (bonus) If you then close the current scene in the scene tab and try reopening it from the FileSystem panel, the editor will briefly freeze before the scene shows up. You can close and reopen yet again to trigger another freeze, for many times. It freezes for 6 seconds on my side.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5370445295/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]